			"notes": "- Instruments request new threads when a channel runs out of room, previously there was a set limit of threads for each type of sample. This will increase accuracy and improving memory use\n- Unused threads are cached to be used for later improving memory use\n- Ram limit has been reduced from 8GB to 4GB\n- Sample packs had there format changed slightly to reduce crashing. The json file is now called just pack.json to prevent crashing when the json and the pack name do not match. the folder instrumentFiles has been changed to samples\n- Sample packs will be auto upgraded on start up\n- The auto updater's download link has been changed to Wynn Music Remastered 1.3.0\n- More than half the project has been completely rewritten plz contact me on my discord server if you experience any bugs or crashing"
